"nirai","text":"திசி","tr":"tici"}]},{"text":"னோரே","tr":"ṉōrē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னோ","tr":"ṉō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரே","tr":"rē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"சேறிரோ","parts":[{"text":"சேறிரோ","lemma":"செல்","gloss":"will you go"}],"gloss":"will you go"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"என்","gloss":"to say"}],"gloss":"to say"},{"surface":"செப்பலும்","parts":[{"text":"செப்பல்","lemma":"செப்பல்","gloss":"saying"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even saying"},{"surface":"ஆற்றாம்","parts":[{"text":"ஆற்றாம்","lemma":"ஆற்று","gloss":"we are unable"}],"gloss":"we are unable"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வருவிரோ","parts":[{"text":"வருவிரோ","lemma":"வா","gloss":"will you come"}],"gloss":"will you come"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"என்","gloss":"to say"}],"gloss":"to say"},{"surface":"வினவலும்","parts":[{"text":"வினவல்","lemma":"வினவல்","gloss":"asking"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even asking"},{"surface":"வினவாம்","parts":[{"text":"வினவாம்","lemma":"வினவு","gloss":"we do not ask"}],"gloss":"we do not ask"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யாங்கு","parts":[{"text":"யாங்கு","lemma":"யாங்கு","gloss":"how"}],"gloss":"how"},{"surface":"செய்வாம்","parts":[{"text":"செய்வாம்","lemma":"செய்","gloss":"we will do"}],"gloss":"we will do"},{"surface":"கொல்","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"expletive of doubt"}],"gloss":"expletive"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"friend"},{"surface":"பாம்பின்","parts":[{"text":"பாம்பு","lemma":"பாம்பு","gloss":"snake"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the snake"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பையுடை","parts":[{"text":"பை","lemma":"பை","gloss":"hood"},{"text":"உடை","lemma":"உடை","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having a hood"},{"surface":"இருந்தலை","parts":[{"text":"இருந்தலை","lemma":"இருந்தலை","gloss":"big head"}],"gloss":"big head","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"துமிக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"துமிக்கும்","lemma":"துமி","gloss":"shattering"}],"gloss":"shattering"},{"surface":"ஏற்றொடு","parts":[{"text":"ஏற்றொடு","lemma":"ஏறு","gloss":"with the thunderbolt"}],"gloss":"with the thunderbolt"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நடுநாள்","parts":[{"text":"நடு","lemma":"நடு","gloss":"middle"},{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"night"}],"gloss":"midnight"},{"surface":"என்னார்","parts":[{"text":"என்னார்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"not considering"}],"gloss":"not considering"},{"surface":"வந்து","parts":[{"text":"வந்து","lemma":"வா","gloss":"having come"}],"gloss":"having come"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நெடு","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"நெடு","gloss":"long"}],"gloss":"long"},{"surface":"மென்","parts":[{"text":"மென்","lemma":"மெல்","gloss":"soft"}],"gloss":"soft"},{"surface":"பணை","parts":[{"text":"பணை","lemma":"பணை","gloss":"bamboo-like"}],"gloss":"bamboo-like"},{"surface":"தோள்","parts":[{"text":"தோள்","lemma":"தோள்","gloss":"shoulders"}],"gloss":"shoulders"},{"surface":"அடைந்திசினோரே","parts":[{"text":"அடைந்திசினோரே","lemma":"அடை","gloss":"he who attained"}],"gloss":"he who attained"}]}],"literal":"\"Will you go?\" thus to say even we are unable / \"Will you come?\" thus to ask even we do not ask / what shall we do, O friend! Of the snake / having a hood, big head, shattering, with the thunderbolt / midnight, not considering, having come / long, soft, bamboo-like shoulders, he who attained.","translation":"\"We cannot say, 'Are you leaving?' nor can we ask, 'Will you return?' What shall we do, my friend? Not caring that it is midnight, when thunderbolts shatter the hooded, large heads of snakes, he comes to embrace her long, soft, bamboo-like shoulders.\"","modern":"தோழியே! 'நீங்கள் போகிறீர்களா?' என்று சொல்லவும் எங்களால் இயலவில்லை. 'மீண்டும் வருவீர்களா?' என்று கேட்கவும் மாட்டோம். பாம்பின் படம் பொருந்திய பெரிய தலையைத் துண்டிக்கும் இடியுடன் கூடிய நள்ளிரவு என்றும் பாராமல், அவளுடைய நீண்ட மென்மையான மூங்கில் போன்ற தோள்களைத் தழுவ அவர் வந்துள்ளார். நாம் இப்போது என்ன செய்வோம்?","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine's companion (தோழி) in the hearing of the hero who has arrived for a secret night meeting. She expresses the deep dilemma they face: they cannot ask him to leave because of their love, yet they cannot ask him when he will return, as that highlights the pain of separation. The poem is set in the Kuriñci (mountainous) landscape, where night journeys are filled with danger. The image of thunderbolts shattering the heads of hooded snakes in the midnight darkness emphasizes the perilous path the hero takes. By highlighting these dangers, the companion indirectly urges the hero to stop these risky secret visits and seek a formal marriage.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.47],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.24],[1.3,1.8],[1.8,2.14],[2.23,2.77],[2.77,3.5],[3.5,3.68],[3.68,4.4],[4.4,4.9],[4.9,5.7],[5.7,6.49],[6.49,6.61],[6.61,7.4],[7.4,7.7],[7.7,8.3],[8.3,8.8],[8.8,8.9],[8.9,10.0],[10.0,10.6],[10.6,11.05],[11.15,11.2]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.3],[1.5,1.8],[1.8,2.2],[2.3,2.9],[2.9,3.24],[3.24,3.7],[3.7,4.8],[4.8,5.2],[5.2,6.2],[6.2,6.2],[6.2,7.6],[7.6,8.1],[8.1,8.5],[8.5,9.5],[9.5,9.9],[9.9,10.1],[10.1,11.2],[11.2,11.8],[11.8,12.35],[12.45,12.5]]}}